 "description": "世界で2番目に大きい島、ニューギニア島。赤道近くの熱帯にありながら、地図だけでは見えてこない不思議がいくつも隠れています。今回は、地形・人間社会・生き物の視点から、この巨大島の謎に迫ります。\n\n【主要参考資料】\n・The Cryosphere\nBrief communication: Tropical glaciers on Puncak Jaya (Irian Jaya/West Papua, Indonesia) close to extinction\nhttps://tc.copernicus.org/articles/19/6629/2025/\n\n・National Statistical Office, Papua New Guinea\nPopulation | National Statistical Office | Papua New Guinea\nhttps://www.nso.gov.pg/statistics/population/\n\n・UNFPA Papua New Guinea\nNational Population Estimate 2021\nhttps://png.unfpa.org/en/publications/national-population-estimate-2021\n\n・Our World in Data\nPapua New Guinea has more living languages than any other country\nhttps://ourworldindata.org/data-insights/papua-new-guinea-has-more-living-languages-than-any-other-country\n\n・Australian Museum\nMarsupials found alive after 6,000 years of extinction\nhttps://australian.museum/about/organisation/media-centre/marsupials-rediscovered-vogelkop-papua/\n\n・Human Rights Watch\nSomething to Hide?: Indonesia’s Restrictions on Media Freedom and Rights Monitoring in Papua\nhttps://www.hrw.org/report/2015/11/11/something-hide/indonesias-restrictions-media-freedom-and-rights-monitoring-papua\n\n\n\n【お知らせ】\nいつも応援ありがとうございます！\nメンバーシップで今後の活動をサポートしていただけると、大きな励みになります。\nhttps://www.youtube.com/channel/UCWX0rU4o9CR8nUJKz0bSMlQ/join\n\n▼使用素材\n■映像素材・画像素材\npixabay\nhttps://pixabay.com/ja/videos/\npexels\nhttps://www.pexels.com/ja-jp/videos/\nACイラスト\nhttps://www.ac-illust.com/\nFreepik\nhttps://jp.freepik.com/\nSILHOUETTE DESIGN\nhttps://kage-design.com/\n\n■音源素材\nartlist\nhttps://artlist.io/\nhttps://pocketse.booth.pm/items/3767621\n効果音ラボ\nhttps://soundeffect-lab.info/\n\n【楽曲提供：株式会社ウナシ】\n\n#ゆっくり解説 #地理 #地政学",
